# Common errors
E10000 = Invalid request.
E10001 = An unexpected error occurred. Please try again.
E10002 = Check the form for errors.
E10003 = The request is not authorized.
E10004 = The request is not permitted.
E10005 = The requested resource was not found.
E10006 = The requested resource is invalid, unavailable, or outside the grant.
E10007 = The resource registry could not be read.
E10008 = The pushed authorization request could not be stored or consumed.

E10009 = The requested scope is not supported.
